entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E6gSBZ1LhW8Q7kNvwH12O47&_nc_oc=Adpr0yuhmmqFzlDB96nyMPJOk0LvK9DpHHmn_fhTro6HtPcwDMB6R5gF7iJljqW2EQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQv6oDKmixeX_3n9MeGxwxYCKXG6E_X952fgV0PAYDnpQ&oe=6B09CD6F"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5J4UKwcM3qQQ7kNvwFXii-n&_nc_oc=AdqWz_P28ltGKLixOi9WknL08A6_H7-qa4dirMk7DGIESCtFk3duKOBtBBtlIXE3IOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTR5Gcx0VbdNGR0ltA2t_GKXq8JCtmnyA9lawE-T5xNeQ&oe=6B09B3AD"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JAniszj1OzoQ7kNvwEMigfk&_nc_oc=Adq6TIsLRM1V4BHni7rmW4eJpEQSWPWh6BhgReoP8lcbzlNFdD9P7ghTbMbtRrxfwWU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVEoVwpLQ0qGgze4cozEjlp3twt90maJ9D3iKIGFiOGw&oe=6B09ABB9"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49